{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}Health Data Privacy Notice — {{ brand.name }}{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
<div class="container py-4" style="max-width: 760px;">
    <h1 class="fw-bold mb-1">NouriLoop Health Data Privacy Notice</h1>
    <p class="text-muted">Effective date: June 9, 2026 · Last updated: October 12, 2026</p>

    <p>This notice explains how NouriLoop LLC (“NouriLoop,” “we”) handles the
    health and wellness information you provide. Please read it before uploading
    health metrics.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">1. What this covers</h2>
    <p>Health and wellness data you choose to add to NouriLoop, and what NouriLoop
    works out from it, including:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Health metrics</strong> you import (e.g., weight, body fat, blood
        glucose, blood pressure, heart rate, steps, sleep) by file upload or an
        automated export from your phone;</li>
        <li><strong>Symptom check-ins</strong> you record;</li>
        <li><strong>The analysis of your meals</strong> — the nutrition estimates
        derived from the meal photos and descriptions you submit, your dietary
        inflammation score, your nutrient gaps, your blood glucose response to
        meals, and your goal progress;</li>
        <li>Account info (email, display name) and notification preferences/phone number.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">2. How we use it</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>To display your dashboards, trends, and 7-day nutrient-gap / supplement insights;</li>
        <li>To run the food-photo analysis that estimates nutrition;</li>
        <li>To run the AI features you choose to use: goal setup and check-ins,
        AI Pattern Coach, “What if?” predictions, and the help assistant;</li>
        <li>To send the notifications you have <strong>opted in</strong> to (all
        notifications are off by default);</li>
        <li>To operate, secure, and maintain the service.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">3. Who we share it with (service providers only)</h2>
    <p>We do <strong>not sell</strong> your health data and do <strong>not</strong>
    share it for advertising. We share the minimum necessary with processors that
    operate the service on our behalf:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Anthropic</strong> (Claude API) — runs NouriLoop’s AI features.
        It receives only what the feature you are using needs:
            <ul>
                <li>meal, recipe, and supplement-label photos, plus what you add
                while an estimate is being made or refined — meal descriptions and
                notes, your answers to the AI’s follow-up questions, and ingredient
                corrections — for nutrition analysis;</li>
                <li>your <strong>blood glucose readings</strong> and the meals
                around them, if you use AI Pattern Coach (paid plans);</li>
                <li>your nutrition averages, dietary inflammation score, nutrient
                gaps, and goal progress, plus what you type into the goal-setup
                chat or a “What if?” scenario and the favorite meal or supplement
                a scenario names, for goal setup and check-ins and for “What if?”
                predictions;</li>
                <li>the questions you ask the help assistant.</li>
            </ul>
            If you connect <strong>your own AI provider</strong> under Settings ▸ AI
            provider, the same information goes to the service you choose (Anthropic,
            OpenRouter, or another service you name), under that service’s terms, instead
            of to Anthropic on our account. Your API key is stored encrypted and is used
            only to make those requests for you.
        </li>
        <li><strong>Twilio</strong> — your mobile number and message text, only if you
        enable SMS.</li>
        <li><strong>IONOS</strong> — to deliver email notifications and
        password resets.</li>
        <li>Disclosures required by law, or to protect rights and safety.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">4. Storage, security, and location</h2>
    <p>Your data is stored in our database on servers located in the United States. We
    use reasonable administrative and technical safeguards — encrypted transport
    (HTTPS/TLS), authentication, and access controls. No system is perfectly secure,
    and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">5. Data retention</h2>
    <p>We keep your data while your account is active and as needed to provide the
    service. You may request deletion at any time (see Your rights); we delete or
    de-identify it subject to any legal retention obligations.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">6. Your rights</h2>
    <p>Depending on where you live, you may have rights to access, export, correct, or
    delete your personal/health information (e.g., under the CCPA/CPRA or GDPR). To
    exercise them, contact us at info@nouriloop.com. You can also delete individual meals
    in the app and turn off any notification at any time.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">7. HIPAA</h2>
    <p>HIPAA applies to “covered entities” (health plans, healthcare providers,
    clearinghouses) and their business associates. NouriLoop is a
    <strong>direct-to-consumer wellness tool</strong>: the data here is information
    <strong>you</strong> voluntarily provide about yourself, so NouriLoop is
    <strong>not acting as a HIPAA covered entity</strong>, and this notice is
    <strong>not</strong> a HIPAA Notice of Privacy Practices. If you received NouriLoop
    through, or use it on behalf of, a healthcare provider or health plan, that
    organization’s HIPAA notice governs your information with them.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">8. Children</h2>
    <p>NouriLoop is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly
    collect their information.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">9. Changes &amp; contact</h2>
    <p>We may update this notice and will revise the “Last updated” date. Questions:
    NouriLoop LLC, 5441 S Macadam Ave Ste N, Portland OR 97239, info@nouriloop.com.</p>
</div>
{% endblock %}
